@host = http://localhost:5002

### Every config, with no context
GET {{host}}/configs

### A paid plan, which matches the temporary-feature-flag targeting rule
GET {{host}}/configs?id=user-123&plan=pro

### An array trait, which matches the day-of-the-week-config rule
GET {{host}}/configs?id=user-3&tags=beta&tags=vip

### Resolution details: reason, variant and error code for each evaluation
GET {{host}}/configs/details?id=user-123&plan=pro

### The provider's name and status
GET {{host}}/health
